WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 12.9 · Partnerships & Ecosystem Building
Partnership risk and conflict resolution

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Expect partnership risks and agree how to disagree before you need to.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Add partnership risks to your main register, with owners.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Agree escalation steps, with timescales, in advance.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Act at once on fraud or safeguarding concerns.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Tide Line: if a new village head withdraws permission, Wayan raises it early; land disputes go to the village head under custom.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write partnership risks and a conflict resolution path.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
